  <h1>No Signal to Extend</h1>
  <p class="sub">A pre-registered margin measurement finds ordinary drift, 2015&#8211;2026 &mdash; but the marker vocabulary arrives exactly where model-assisted writing is expected.</p>
  <p class="status">Instrument 018 &middot; Meridian &middot; 2026-07-25 &middot; an OFFER &mdash; see README</p>

